// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2393928884" "Ranged (Cone), Minor DMG (Cold), Minor DoT (Negative Energy), -DEF(Foe, Cold/Negative Energy), -RES(Foe, Cold/Negative Energy), Knockup(Foe), Chance for +EndCost(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3932976455" "You wind up a massive smash, striking the ground with tremendous force. This unleashes a shock wave of death energy in a cone which causes cold damage, with the lingering effect of death also dealing negative energy damage over time. Additionally, the target's defense against and resistance to cold and negative energy attacks are reduced. Finally, the longer the Sentinel remains alive, the more likely his presence will sap the target's soul, causing them to suffer increased endurance cost for all powers."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2625185174" "-RES (Cold & Negative Energy), Chance for +EndCost"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1584763563" "Your resistance against cold and negative energy attacks has been reduced, and there is the potential for your powers to cost more endurance to execute."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1096808214" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} chills you, causing {Damage} points of cold damage and reducing your defense against its attacks."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P940855137" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} weakens your soul, causing {Damage} points of negative energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P797178642" "{PlayerSource} has knocked you off your feet with its {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4179021727" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} has increased the endurance cost of your powers!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frigid Stomp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4176953553" "Frigid Stomp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1495410902" "PBAoE, Moderate DMG (Cold, Negative Energy), EndDrain(Foe), Knockup(Foe), -Regen(Foe), -Rec(Foe), Chance for +EndCost(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2659927157" "You stomp the ground with tremendous force, unleashing a shockwave of death energy that strikes nearby targets for cold and negative energy damage. Additionally, the affected targets suffer from endurance drain and reduced regeneration and recovery. Finally, the longer the Sentinel remains alive, the more likely his presence will sap the target's soul, causing them to suffer increased endurance cost for all powers."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3713288992" "-End, -Regen, -Rec, Chance for +EndCost"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2748106757" "You are suffering from endurance drain and from reduced regeneration and recovery. There is also the potential for your powers to cost more endurance to execute."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P873258950" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} chills you, causing {Damage} points of cold damage and reducing your regeneration and recovery."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Reapers Bolt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3810171802" "Reaper's Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P348239392" "Ranged (Secondary Target), Moderate DMG(Negative Energy), Minor DoT(Negative Energy), EndDrain(Foe), -Rec(Foe), Chance for +EndCost(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P681909925" "You unleash a bolt of death energy at a single target. The affected target suffers from negative energy damage over time, endurance drain and reduced recovery. Additionally, the longer the Sentinel remains alive, the more likely his presence will sap the target's soul, causing them to suffer increased endurance cost for all powers."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2933342662" "-End, -Rec, Chance for +EndCost"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P773186010" "You are suffering from endurance drain and from reduced recovery. There is also the potential for your powers to cost more endurance to execute."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2619878240" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with its {PowerName}, causing {Damage} points of negative energy damage, reducing your recovery and draining your endurance."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P438997995" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} continues to drain you, causing {Damage} points of negative energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frenzied Slash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
