"P4058240048" "Frenzied Slash"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P709375339" "Melee, Minor DoT(Cold, Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P805110084" "You slash violently at your target, causing several quick bursts of cold and lethal damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P77530715" "DoT(Cold, Lethal)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2836489865" "You have been affected by the Sentinel's touch and suffer cold and lethal damage over time."
