// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4078457719" "You suffer bleeding wounds from {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} and take {Damage} points of lethal damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Enervating Strike 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4077407169" "Enervating Strike"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3951895523" "Melee, -Res(Heal, Foe, Stacking), -Regen(Foe, Stacking)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4030449119" "Your focus on a single target gradually drains their body's ability to recover. The longer you remain focused on a single target, the worse this becomes, until they are no longer able to regenerate on their own or be healed."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1619405380" "Stacking -Regen, -RES(Heal)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3454610983" "Your regeneration rate and healing effectiveness have been reduced. This effect will stack up to 5 times, but can be eliminated by diverting the Sentinel's attention to another target."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2543158708" "{PlayerSource} hits you with an {PowerName}, reducing regeneration and healing effectiveness."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frigid Grasp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2518891674" "Frigid Grasp"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4090855954" "Ranged (Secondary Target), Moderate DMG(Cold), Minor DoT(Negative Energy), Grounded(Foe), -Speed(Foe,All), -Rech(Foe), Chance for +EndCost(Foe), Heal(Self)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2310069644" "You freeze a single target in a mass of death energy. The target is held and suffers cold damage, as well as negative energy damage over time. Some of the drained health is returned to you, healing you. The target also suffers lingering reductions in their movement and recharge speeds after the hold ends. Finally, the longer the Sentinel remains alive, the more likely his presence will sap the target's soul, causing them to suffer increased endurance cost for all powers."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3404880007" "Hold, -Speed(All), -Rech, Chance for +EndCost"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4046402808" "You have been caught in a mass of frozen death energy and have been held. When the hold ends, you will suffer reduced movement and attack speeds. There is also the potential for your powers to cost more endurance to execute."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P532516471" "{PlayerSource} reaches out with its {PowerName}, freezing you in place with the cold hand of death!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2944298423" "The intense cold of {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} chills you for {Damage} points of cold damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2479152340" "The death energy of {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} drains you for {Damage} points of negative energy damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P746236466" "You suffer from the reduction in movement and slowed recharge aftereffects of {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}."

